  <div class="sp-modal" data-modal="login" hidden><div class="sp-modal-card"><button class="sp-modal-close" data-modal-close aria-label="Tutup">×</button><span class="sp-kicker">SELAMAT DATANG KEMBALI</span><h2>Masuk ke akun</h2><p class="sp-modal-intro">Pilih peran, lalu masukkan data akunmu.</p><form data-auth-form data-mode="login"><label>Jenis akun<select name="role" data-role-select><option value="customer">Pelanggan</option><option value="seller">Penjual</option><option value="owner">Owner</option></select></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="username" placeholder="nama@email.com"></label><label>Kata sandi<input name="password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Kata sandi akun"></label><div class="sp-message" data-form-message hidden></div><button class="sp-button sp-button-dark sp-button-full" type="submit">Masuk <span>↗</span></button></form><p class="sp-auth-switch">Belum punya akun pelanggan? <button data-modal-tab="register">Buat akun</button></p></div></div>
  <div class="sp-modal" data-modal="register" hidden><div class="sp-modal-card sp-modal-card-wide"><button class="sp-modal-close" data-modal-close aria-label="Tutup">×</button><span class="sp-kicker">MULAI DI SHOPPOLITEKNIK</span><h2>Buat akun</h2><p class="sp-modal-intro">Pilih jenis akun. Formulir akan menyesuaikan.</p><form data-auth-form data-mode="register"><label>Jenis akun<select name="role" data-role-select><option value="customer">Pelanggan</option><option value="owner" data-owner-only hidden>Owner pertama</option><option value="seller">Penjual</option></select></label><div data-account-registration-fields><div class="sp-form-grid"><label>Nama lengkap<input name="name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Nama kamu"></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="email" placeholder="nama@email.com"></label><label>Nomor telepon <small>Opsional</small><input name="phone" maxlength="30" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="08xxxxxxxxxx"></label><label>Kata sandi<input name="password" type="password" required minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Minimal 8 karakter"></label><label class="sp-grid-full">Ulangi kata sandi<input name="password_confirmation" type="password" required minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Ketik ulang kata sandi"></label></div></div><div data-owner-registration-fields hidden><div class="sp-form-grid"><label>Nama owner<input name="owner_name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Nama owner"></label><label>Email owner<input name="owner_email" type="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="email" placeholder="email@contoh.com"></label><label class="sp-grid-full">Kata sandi owner<input name="owner_password" type="password" required minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Minimal 12 karakter"></label></div><p class="sp-hint">Owner pertama langsung masuk ke dashboard setelah akun berhasil dibuat.</p></div><div data-seller-registration-fields hidden><div class="sp-role-note"><b>Informasi usaha penjual</b><p>Permohonan akan ditinjau owner. Isi barang, keuntungan, berat, dan paket.</p></div><div class="sp-form-grid"><label>Apakah kamu sudah berjualan?<select name="seller_status" required><option value="active">Ya, sudah berjualan</option><option value="planning">Belum, sedang memulai</option></select></label><label>Barang yang ingin dijual<input name="product_name" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Nama produk"></label><label>Kategori barang<input name="product_category" required maxlength="60" placeholder="Kategori"></label><label>Berat barang (gram)<input name="item_weight_grams" type="number" min="1" required placeholder="350"></label><label>Estimasi keuntungan per bulan (Rp)<input name="expected_monthly_profit" type="number" min="0" required placeholder="1500000"></label><label>Paket website<select name="monthly_plan" required><option value="trial">Masa uji coba / gratis</option><option value="monthly">Paket bulanan</option></select></label><label>Anggaran bulanan (Rp) <small>Opsional</small><input name="monthly_budget" type="number" min="0" placeholder="Perkiraan"></label><label class="sp-grid-full">Deskripsi dan rencana jualan<textarea name="product_description" required maxlength="255" rows="3" placeholder="Ceritakan produk dan target pembeli"></textarea></label></div><p class="sp-hint">Belum ada pemotongan otomatis. Owner mengonfirmasi tarif sebelum paket berbayar dimulai.</p></div><div class="sp-message" data-form-message hidden></div><button class="sp-button sp-button-dark sp-button-full" type="submit" data-submit-register>Buat akun <span>↗</span></button></form><p class="sp-auth-switch">Sudah terdaftar? <button data-modal-tab="login">Masuk</button></p><p class="sp-modal-footer-link">Ingin halaman formulir terpisah? <a href="daftar.html">Buka pendaftaran penuh</a></p></div></div>
